      "id": "G2_MCP_Gmail_Suite_trigger_mcp",
      "name": "MCP Trigger",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpTrigger",
      "position": [
        250,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "G2_MCP_Gmail_Suite_trigger_chat",
      "name": "Chat Trigger",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger",
      "position": [
        250,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "initialMessages": "Hello! I'm your MCP Gmail Suite Pro assistant. How can I help you?"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "G2_MCP_Gmail_Suite_agent",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        500,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "hasMemory": true,
        "text": "={{ $json.message }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "G2_MCP_Gmail_Suite_llm",
      "name": "LLM (gemini-2.5-flash)",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini",
      "position": [
        750,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "gemini-2.5-flash"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "G2_MCP_Gmail_Suite_memory",
      "name": "Persistent Memory",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryPostgresChat",
      "position": [
        750,
        400
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sessionId": "={{ $json.sessionId }}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "G2_MCP_Gmail_Suite_output_parser",
      "name": "Structured Output Parser",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "position": [
        750,
        600
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "G2_MCP_Gmail_Suite_tool_gmail",
      "name": "Gmail Tool",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTool",
      "position": [
        1000,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "G2_MCP_Gmail_Suite_error_set",
      "name": "Error Fallback Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "position": [
        1250,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "value": "I encountered an error processing your request. Let me try a different approach."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "G2_MCP_Gmail_Suite_doc_note",
      "name": "📋 Documentation",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        50,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## MCP Gmail Suite Pro\n\nConsolidación de MCP_Gmail_Voz (2 copias exactas) + MCP Gmail (2 copias, 93.33% similar). Resultado: workflow unificado con MCP trigger, voice input, gmail tools, y structured output.\n\n**Consolidated from**: 4 original workflows\n**LLM**: gemini-2.5-flash\n**Memory**: PostgresChatHistory (persistent)\n**Error Workflow**: G13_Error_Handler\n\n### Refactoring Applied:\n- Unificar 4 variantes Gmail en 1 workflow MCP Gmail Suite\n- MCP Trigger como entrada principal + Gmail Tool como agente tool\n- Añadir gmailTool + gmailTrigger para dual input (MCP + Email trigger)\n- Gemini 2.5 Flash como LLM primario (clasificación/email成本低)\n- PostgresChatHistory para historial de emails procesados",
        "width": 200,
        "height": 150
      }
    }
  ],
